124
00:32:50,670 --> 00:32:57,670
If it is a C module, it will be tested using Cantata or GTest. If it is an ASW or ESP module, it will be tested using Ascet.

125
00:33:09,540 --> 00:33:31,640
The MT_Needed column is used to show whether the module has already been tested. If it has, it will be mapped as Delta, and the effort for Delta will also be calculated.

126
00:33:31,640 --> 00:34:52,230
I will apply the formula to all items here.

126
00:34:48,640 --> 00:34:52,230
