131
00:36:05,100 --> 00:36:13,360
If that C module is tested using GTest, it will be calculated based on a different ELOC. If it is tested using Cantata, it will be calculated based on another different ELOC.

132
00:36:13,360 --> 00:36:25,510
The same applies to Ascet. If it is ESP, it will be calculated using the Ascet formula.

133
00:36:25,510 --> 00:36:38,780
